<title>SINGAPORE: Imax signs Thailand and Philipines deals.</title>
<headline>Imax signs Thailand and Philipines deals.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giant screen and three-dimensional theatre company Imax Corp said on Tuesday it had signed agreements in Thailand and the Philippines for its Ridefilm motion simulator.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the agreements were for one Ridefilm simulator with Thailand's Major Cineplex and at least one and up to five simulators with the Uniwide Sales Group of the Philippines.</p>
<p>As of September 1996, there were 144 permanent IMAX theatres in 21 countries with a backlog of 44 theatre systems scheduled to open in the next few years, it said.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
